{"id":7800,"date":"2021-09-26T12:45:00","date_gmt":"2021-09-26T16:45:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7800"},"modified":"2021-10-10T09:42:53","modified_gmt":"2021-10-10T13:42:53","slug":"kc-to-spearfish-and-beyond-installment-4","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/09\/26\/kc-to-spearfish-and-beyond-installment-4\/","title":{"rendered":"KC to Spearfish and beyond (Installment 4)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>After Kansas City, we worked our way north and spent our first night&#8217;s stopover at a great little city park in Elk Point, South Dakota.  $15\/nite for 50 amp electric and water.  There&#8217;s a dump station, but we didn&#8217;t need it.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The park has multiple ball diamonds, multiple picnic shelters, plenty of scattered picnic tables, and loads of playground equipment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Read the plaque below and you&#8217;ll learn about how this site was actually a stopover for Lewis &amp; Clark.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073328817-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073328817-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7811\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073328817-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073328817-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073328817-1-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Historical  Marker at Elk Point City Park<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161604747.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161604747.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7802\" class=\"wp-image-7802\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161604747.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161604747-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161604747-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161947379.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161947379.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7803\" class=\"wp-image-7803\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161947379.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161947379-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_161947379-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162239166.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162239166.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7804\" class=\"wp-image-7804\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162239166.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162239166-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162239166-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162944983.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162944983.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7805\" class=\"wp-image-7805\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162944983.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162944983-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210831_162944983-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073402815.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073402815.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7808\" class=\"wp-image-7808\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073402815.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073402815-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_073402815-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074428969.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074428969.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7810\" class=\"wp-image-7810\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074428969.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074428969-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074428969-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074359912.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074359912.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7809\" class=\"wp-image-7809\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074359912.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074359912-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210901_074359912-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls loop src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/Elk-Point-SD-Zipline.mp4\" playsinline><\/video><figcaption>Kathy enjoying the playground at Elk Point<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After Elk Point, we moved on and arrived at Spearfish South Dakota where we enjoyed meeting up with friends Matt and Sherry, Jim and Brenda, and Paul and Chris (who we spent a couple days with in Mason City Iowa) and they stopped by on their way to Rapid City.  The next day David and Susan came on up from Custer State Park where they were volunteering to join us all for the day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Spearfish, as you might recall is the town where some of us volunteered at DC Booth Historic National Fish Hatchery a couple years ago.  It was good to see the recently re-painted fish car!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 \/ 1080;\" width=\"1920\" controls src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/Booth-Campfire.mp4\"><\/video><figcaption>It was great to spend the evening around the campfire at Volunteer Village again<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_133640113_HDR-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_133640113_HDR-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7824\" class=\"wp-image-7824\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_133640113_HDR-1.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_133640113_HDR-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_133640113_HDR-1-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Enjoying dinner at the Farmhouse<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210903_081757232.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210903_081757232.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7817\" class=\"wp-image-7817\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210903_081757232.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210903_081757232-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210903_081757232-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Jim &amp; Brenda&#8217;s rig<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_112954427.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_112954427.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7818\" class=\"wp-image-7818\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_112954427.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_112954427-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210902_112954427-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The DC Booth Fish Car<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082116888.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082116888.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7819\" class=\"wp-image-7819\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082116888.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082116888-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082116888-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Campers having a birthday party<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082126682.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082126682.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7820\" class=\"wp-image-7820\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082126682.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082126682-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210905_082126682-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">These types of campers are becoming more popular<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FB_IMG_1630853742914.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"504\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FB_IMG_1630853742914.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7821\" class=\"wp-image-7821\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FB_IMG_1630853742914.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FB_IMG_1630853742914-300x199.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FB_IMG_1630853742914-685x454.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/FB_IMG_1630853742914-342x228.jpg 342w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">An early RV<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>While at Spearfish, I noticed a small leak under the coach.  It was coming from the &#8220;wet bay&#8221;, where the waste tanks (and the drain pipe) are located.  Further inspection showed that the 3&#8243; pipe coming out of the black tank had a very small leak at one of the fittings.  I could see (once I got down on my hands and knees) that this joint had been repaired before by the previous owner.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We were fortunate in that a RV repair shop was just up the road in Belle Fourche (pronounced &#8220;Bell Foosh&#8221;).  I called them, explained our plight that we were full-time RV&#8217;ers and were planning to head out tomorrow to Fort Peck Montana for a few days.  They had us bring it right on in.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Jim the owner came on out and looked over the situation, assured us he had the necessary fittings and could get us back on the road in a couple hours.  He did a great job, I was right by his side and we had some great conversation while he was doing the repair.  It ended up he took out all the old, and provided new fittings and a new elbow and we were out of there and back to Spearfish before noon that day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7828\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-scaled.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7828\" class=\"wp-image-7828\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_105755262-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Bottom of the black tank with the leaking fitting (caulked previously)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7829\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-scaled.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7829\" class=\"wp-image-7829\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_132620959-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Outside the shop<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7830\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-scaled.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7830\" class=\"wp-image-7830\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_141047508-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The drain elbow with the black tank fitting removed<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7831\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7831\" class=\"wp-image-7831\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210907_153601443-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Smiling customer Herb with Progress RV owner Jim<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After about a week, we traveled north back up to Fort Peck Montana and the U.S. Army Corp of Engineers campground we had volunteered at in 2019.  We wanted to check in on the two rangers we had worked for while we were there.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>On the way, we stopped for an overnight stay at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitmt.com\/places-to-go\/cities-and-towns\/miles-city.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Miles City Montana<\/a>.  We were going to stay at the local Elks Lodge, but it was in a noisy downtown district right along a truck route and we were fortunate to stumble across the local county fairgrounds.  We had a very quiet and restful evening parked alongside the ag building.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The next morning we found a great little coffee shop downtown where we got our morning boost (and a little something sweet too!)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-1024x768.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7835\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7835\" class=\"wp-image-7835\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_075708374-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Our spot in the fairgrounds<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-1024x768.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7836\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7836\" class=\"wp-image-7836\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_082029462-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The old train station Miles City MT<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-1024x768.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7839\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7839\" class=\"wp-image-7839\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_090441604-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The Ugly Mug Coffee Shop<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-1024x768.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7841\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7841\" class=\"wp-image-7841\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084626521-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Apple Crunch Danish (we shared this one)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7843\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-scaled.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7843\" class=\"wp-image-7843\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210909_084358693-1-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Inside the shop<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After our morning boost we visited the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.rangeridersmuseum.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Range Riders Museum<\/a> right across the street from the fairgrounds.  I have never been in a museum with such a wide range of collections.  It was great to talk to the ladies up front and find out a little about the &#8220;Range Riders&#8221;.  These were ranchers and cowboys who worked their livestock on the open range (no fences).  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The museum was founded in the 1930&#8217;s and still operates with mostly volunteers.  Although I took tons of pictures while visiting, I now find they have a great web site with a lot of great information about the museum.  I invite you to take a few minutes and explore the <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.rangeridersmuseum.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Range Riders Museum<\/a> to learn about a lost way of life in western America.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;d like to see my photos, <a href=\"https:\/\/photos.app.goo.gl\/CZ8fTm8VVuYM12g2A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">you can follow this link<\/a> to my Google Photos album of the museum.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From <a href=\"https:\/\/www.visitmt.com\/places-to-go\/cities-and-towns\/miles-city.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Miles City<\/a> we made it the rest of the way up to Fort Peck for a couple days.  Check out the picture below that shows the final result of one of the volunteers who made the little camper lending library. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It was good to visit with both Ranger Scott and Ranger Sue again.  Since the Interpretive Center is a federal building, masks are required.  Scott is in charge of the campground and Sue is responsible for the Interpretive Center.  To see more of our time at Fort Peck back in 2019 <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/06\/17\/camp-hosting-at-fort-peck-montana\/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"5836\">you can follow this link<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7848\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-scaled.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7848\" class=\"wp-image-7848\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_182047784-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Our site at Fort Peck Dam Campground<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210910_173239036-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_2021