ds\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"7850\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=7850\" class=\"wp-image-7850\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/IMG_20210912_102414618_HDR-2000x1500.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Ranger Sue @ the Interpretive Center<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>There&#8217;s more &#8230; but I&#8217;ll save that for another time.  Thanks for riding along, hope I didn&#8217;t bore you too much.  I know I can get a little wordy and I&#8217;ll work on the next post to cut out some of the details.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks again.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb &amp; Kathy (currently at <a href=\"https:\/\/gfp.sd.gov\/parks\/detail\/angostura-recreation-area\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Angostura Recreation Area &#8211; Hot Springs SD<\/a>)<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>After Kansas City, we worked our way north and spent our first night&#8217;s stopover at a great little city park in Elk Point, South Dakota. $15\/nite for 50 amp electric and water. There&#8217;s a dump station, but we didn&#8217;t need it. The park has multiple ball diamonds, multiple picnic shelters, plenty of scattered picnic tables, &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/09\/26\/kc-to-spearfish-and-beyond-installment-4\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">KC to Spearfish and beyond (Installment 4)<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,677,264,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707995,554707996,554707738,554707998,554707997,554707992,554707695,23317,554707994,554707756,554707993,554707696,554707770],"class_list":["post-7800","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-friends","category-learning","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-black-tank","tag-elk-point","tag-fort-peck","tag-installment-4","tag-lewis-clark","tag-miles-city","tag-montana","tag-museum","tag-range-riders","tag-ranger","tag-rv-repair","tag-south-dakota","tag-spearfish"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7800","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7800"}],"version-history":[{"count":16,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7800\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":8141,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7800\/revisions\/8141"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-jso